cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Synthetic Survey Data Generator"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Jack
repository-code: "https://github.com/ttzji/synthetic-survey-generator"
license: PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-06"
abstract: >-
  Generates synthetic survey responses for researcher-supplied scale items,
  calibrated against U.S. General Social Survey answer distributions where a
  strong match exists, with a confidence label and an empirical error rate for
  every item. Intended for pretesting survey items, not for replacing human data.
keywords:
  - synthetic survey data
  - large language models
  - survey pretesting
  - General Social Survey
